    daily_focus_banner_label: "Today's direction",
    faq_a_nb_shopping_link: "The 'Shopping' page in the 'Home lists' notebook is connected to the app's Shopping List – it's the same list in two places. Whatever is added, ticked or deleted on the page happens in the Shopping List too, and the other way around. 'To the list' at the top of the page opens the Shopping List itself.",
    faq_a_recipes_gallery: "In My Recipes all the recipes are in one gallery: search by name or by an ingredient, or tap a category tag. 📷 scans a recipe and ＋ adds a new one. Inside a recipe, tick ✓ next to what's already at home – one tap sends everything else to the shopping list (only what isn't there yet). − / + changes the number of servings and the amounts change with it, and 'Eat today' adds one serving to today's meals.",
    faq_q_nb_shopping_link: "Why does the Shopping page in my notebook show my Shopping List?",
    faq_q_recipes_gallery: "How do I find a recipe and send what's missing to the shopping list?",
