    dictation_btn_aria: "Speak and it's written",
    dictation_mic_denied: "No microphone permission – it can be allowed in the browser or phone settings",
    faq_a_dictation: "Yes – tap the 🎤 microphone in the corner of the quick note, the weekly note or a notebook writing page, and speak: the words are written as you talk, in the app's language. Tap it again to stop. The first time, the browser asks for permission to use the microphone. Works in Chrome / Android and in Safari on iPhone.",
    faq_q_dictation: "Can I speak instead of typing?",
    faq_a_secret_room: "A room that's only yours, inside New Me. You see one wall at a time and turn with the arrows (or a swipe). The first key comes after a ✓ on a meal on 3 different days and opens the door – and then each of the 20 challenges gives a key that opens one more thing: the computer, the game, the shelf (with the library inside it), the star roof, the places behind the hallway doors, the studio and small surprises in every place. When something opens, an arrow shows the way to it. The full list is in \"How does the room work?\". The last challenge brings a bottle from the sea, with the letter from the past inside. On the star roof, a tapped star falls like a shooting star, and a tap on the cat brings it over to be petted.",
