    faq_a_table_shopping_link: "In a ✓ column connected to the shopping list (like 'Have ingredients' in 'This week's meals'), every row that isn't ticked yet has a 🛒. One tap adds it to the shopping list – only once, never twice. Tick it ✓ here and it leaves the list; delete it from the list and it no longer shows as 'on the list' here; mark it as bought in the list and the row here gets its ✓ by itself. Any ✓ column can be connected or disconnected in the column's settings.",
