    glib_weight_note: "Pick a target weight that feels right – the path fills in with every weigh-in.",
    premium_benefit_goal_library: "The whole goal library – every ready plan",
    vision_goal_delete_routine_note: "Its items in My Routine will be deleted too.",
    faq_a_goal_small_steps: "Every goal in My Goals is a path: the stations already behind you, today's glowing stone and the trophy at the end. Give a goal a small step – every day, or every week on a day you choose – something doable even on a hard day, like '10 minutes of easy running'. All of today's small steps show up at the top of My Goals and in My Day, each with a quick ✓, and '✓ I did it today' under a goal's path fills in its last-7-days dots. The note 'On the way to 10 · keep going' stays at the top on purpose: we don't have to be perfect – just do a little every day to move forward.",
    faq_q_goal_small_steps: "What are small steps, and what does 'Not 10' mean?",
