    faq_a_new_me_tour: "Right after buying and filling in the short questionnaire, a short tour shows the hallway of New Me: the lamps (today's meals), the backpack (all of New Me) and door 1 to the secret room. It can be replayed anytime from ⚙️ Plan settings > 🧭 New Me tour – the full name from the questionnaire can be changed there too. Before buying, New Me shows a 🔒 in the menu, and tapping it opens a page with everything that's included.",
