    nm_ch_no_sugar_21_desc: "Three weeks without added sugar – enough time for the cravings to calm down. Fruit and natural sweetness are welcome.",
    nm_ch_no_sugar_21_title: "21 days without sugar",
    nm_ch_no_snacking_14_task: "Only what's on the menu",
    nm_ch_no_snacking_14_desc: "Only what's on the menu and the drinks – no nibbling in between. Feeling hungry? A glass of water or tea, and the next meal is close.",
