    apptour_demo_goal_title: "Run 5 km",
    apptour_nb_inside_text: "Each pocket opens like a binder, with colored dividers to jump between pockets. Notebook pages really turn, and tables get the columns you choose.",
    apptour_nb_inside_title: "Inside the bag",
    faq_a_recipe_to_preset: "Yes. Open the recipe and tap '⭐ Add to Saved Meals'. The name, the calories per serving (or the total if no servings are set) and the ingredients are already filled in, with a matching category – check them, change anything and save. From then on it's one tap away in the Daily Meal Tracker and in 🍎 quick add.",
    faq_q_recipe_to_preset: "Can I turn a recipe into a saved meal?",
    recipe_add_to_presets_btn: "⭐ Add to Saved Meals",
    faq_a_my_notebooks: "Notebooks live in the pockets of My Bag, each with a cover you design – a color, a pattern and a sticker. Inside, the pages are cream paper and turn like in a real notebook: swipe sideways or tap a page in the strip at the bottom, where ＋ adds a new one – lined (for writing), grid (for math and sketches), blank (for drawing) or a checklist. On drawing pages the tools float at the bottom of the page: pen, marker, flat marker and eraser, the color dot for colors and thickness, undo and stickers. 🔍 opens the contents with search, 🔖 marks the page the notebook opens on, and ⋯ holds the cover and details, renaming the page, clearing a drawing and deleting the page. The ✅ Tasks card at the top of My Bag opens your to-do list, with 🪄 Smart Split for big tasks. Notebooks are part of Premium; the Tasks list is free.",
    faq_q_my_notebooks: "How do My Notebooks work?",
