    faq_a_goal_tasks_peek: "Three kinds: the daily tasks of an active days challenge (for example 'No carbs') – they show up every day until the challenge is complete, and a ✓ there ticks the day in the goal (and the other way round); 📅 goal stations you scheduled – on their date, and in the calendar too; and 👣 the small step of any other goal – set it when you add or edit the goal (every day, or every week on a day you choose). These are the same steps as in 'Today's small steps' at the top of My Goals, each with the goal's icon. A +1 logged that day ticks the small step automatically (and so does a weigh-in, when the small step is the weigh-in itself).",
