    share_footer_sent_from: "Sent from NOT10.ai",
    faq_a_goal_days_challenge: "In My Goals tap ＋ (or the ready-made '🔥 8 days' example), choose '📆 Days challenge', enter how many days, and add what you do every day (e.g. 'A 30-minute walk', 'Eat according to my menu'). Every day, tick that day's tasks under the challenge's path – when all of them are ticked the day counts, the path moves one stone forward and your 🔥 streak grows (with no daily tasks there's a single '✓ I did it today' button). The 🔁 button next to a task adds it to My Routine at an hour you choose: ticking it there also ticks it in the goal, and the other way round. Stations of a regular goal can be added to My Routine the same way.",
