    faq_a_app_tour: "The tour opens automatically once, the first time you enter. It shows the big features with an arrow and a short explanation, and peeks inside some of them (for example, a sample goal card that flips to show its steps) – tap Continue to move on, Back to go back, or Skip tour to close it. You can replay it anytime from Settings > Help & Usage > App Tour.",
    faq_q_app_tour: "How do I see the app tour again?",
    apptour_done_text: "Any question? Help & FAQ in Settings answers everything, and this tour is always there under Help & Usage.",
    apptour_done_title: "That's everything! 🎉",
    apptour_flow_recurring: "Installments & standing orders",
    apptour_flow_weight: "Weight",
    apptour_flow_calories: "Today's calories",
