    apptour_s_account_text: "Premium, password, a personal PDF report, Google Calendar sync and account deletion.",
    apptour_s_notifications_text: "Reminder notifications and their sound. '⏰ Not yet' on a reminder works like a snooze: it reminds again every 5 minutes.",
    apptour_s_personalization_text: "Country, meals and snacks per day, when your financial month starts, and what shows on the home screen.",
    apptour_s_appearance_text: "Language, light or dark mode, themes, font, text color, accessibility and app size.",
    apptour_m_style_text: "This button switches the menu to big tiles – and back. Only one of them appears on the home screen.",
