    apptour_m_tables_text: "Personal tables – gifts, series, lists – with text, number, choice, date and ✓ columns (Premium).",
    apptour_m_study_link: "🪄 Smart Split, inside the ✅ Tasks card, breaks a big task into steps on your calendar.",
    apptour_m_study_text: "Your bag: a pocket for every part of life – with notebooks, tables and tasks inside.",
    apptour_m_vision_link: "📅 on a station puts it in the calendar; small steps and a days challenge's tasks show up in My Day, and progress can also follow a number or your weight.",
    apptour_m_vision_text: "Your goals as paths of small steps – with today's steps up top. Let's peek inside 👇",
    apptour_m_myweek_link: "Syncs with Google Calendar (in Settings).",
    apptour_m_myweek_text: "The monthly calendar, recurring weekly tasks with reminders, all your dated events, and a paper diary of the week's meetings 🤝.",
    apptour_m_newme_link: "Everything counts in the Daily Meal Tracker and My Day; weight is shared with Calorie & Weight Metrics.",
    apptour_m_newme_text: "A 1,300 / 1,500 calorie meal plan: today's menu with ✓, smart swaps by calories, a shopping list, meal reminders and a progress journey with achievements, measurements and photos. Plus 🏆 20 challenges – with a gift at the end.",
    apptour_ai_table_text: "Describe the table you need – the AI designs its columns (Premium).",
