    nm_remove: "Remove",
    nm_split_line: "Plan {plan} · Drinks {drinks} · Extras {extra}",
    nm_extras_hint: "From the Daily Meal Tracker and quick add – already counted in the ring.",
    nm_extras_title: "Also eaten today",
    nm_drinks_total: "{n} / ~{kcal} kcal",
    nm_drink_missing: "Enter a drink name and its calories",
    nm_drink_more: "+ Another drink",
    nm_drink_add: "Add",
    nm_drink_name_ph: "Drink (e.g. juice)",
    nm_drinks_hint: "Just type the drink – the calories are calculated automatically, and the number can be changed.",
    nm_slot_drinks: "Drinks",
    faq_a_new_me_tracking: "In New Me's hallway every lamp is a meal: tap a lamp, or ✓ on the note in the backpack, to mark it eaten (the whole menu with ✓ on every meal is also in the whole day, inside the backpack). Everything is synced with the Daily Meal Tracker: plan meals, drinks and anything you add elsewhere (for example a coffee from quick add) are counted together in New Me and in My Day – nothing you already typed is overwritten, and removing a ✓ removes only the New Me part. When all the lamps are lit there's a small celebration. Under 'Drinks', log the day's drinks – all together up to ~150 kcal, which means about 3 drinks of up to ~50 kcal each. Just type the drink's name and the calories are filled in automatically by AI. The two coffee/tea rows also have a 'Milk? How much?' field (for example 'a little' or '50 ml'), and the calculation is updated; the number can be changed before adding and also afterwards. A drink with a name and calories is saved automatically as soon as you move on – tapping Add is optional. Tap ☆ next to a drink to save it as a regular drink – regular drinks appear as buttons at the top of the Drinks card, and one tap adds them to the day. ⭐ saves a meal as a saved meal. 'Daily table' shows what you ate with calories and protein. The 💎 New Me button under 'My Routine' on the home screen opens it directly. Calorie and protein values are AI estimates and may contain errors.",
    faq_q_new_me_tracking: "How do the ✓, swaps and calories work in New Me?",
    faq_a_new_me_what: "New Me is a separate daily meal-plan program with two ready plans – 1,300 or 1,500 calories – built from 2 main meals and 2 snacks, with 3 options for each. It's sold separately from Premium: $5.99 a month (cancel anytime) or $39.99 once for lifetime access. Open it from 💎 New Me in the menu. Before starting, there is a short questionnaire that begins with a medical disclaimer you need to accept. The program is general information only and doesn't replace a doctor or clinical dietitian.",
    faq_q_new_me_what: "What is New Me and how do I get it?",
