    hamburger_group_planning: "Planning & Calendar", categories_menu_title: "All Categories", new_me_coming_soon: "A new personal program is on its way - coming soon.", faq_q_categories_menu: "How do I switch between the ☰ list menu and the ▦ tiles menu?", faq_a_categories_menu: "The app's menu can be shown in one of two ways, and only one button appears at the top: ☰ a list (the default), or ▦ big tiles - Planning & Calendar, Lists, Goals & Progress, Nutrition & Metrics, Sport, and Expenses & Income; tap a tile to see what's inside, then tap what you need. To switch, open the menu and tap the small button at the top of it: ▦ in the list menu switches to tiles, and ☰ in the tiles menu switches back to the list. The tiles menu also has a ⚙️ button for Settings. Your choice is saved and applies on all your devices.",
